"finalSummary\":\"Digest listo (~500 palabras): formatos/ecosistemas DTCG y legacy, outputs CSS (:root, themes, @theme), capacidades ANRE recomendadas, non-goals explícitos (mixins no aparecen en el research), competencia, riesgos/estándares, qué va a arquitectura vs PRD, y decisiones abiertas para el PM.\",\"completedSubtitle\":\"Extracted Spanish requirements digest\"}", "tool": 0, "toolCallBinary": ""}}, {"_v": 3, "type": 2, "approximateLintErrors": [], "lints": [], "codebaseContextChunks": [], "commits": [], "pullRequests": [], "attachedCodeChunks": [], "assistantSuggestedDiffs": [], "gitDiffs": [], "interpreterResults": [], "images": [], "attachedFolders": [], "attachedFoldersNew": [], "bubbleId": "998e01b9-3a44-416d-9911-ddc67ab2c843", "userResponsesToSuggestedCodeBlocks": [], "suggestedCodeBlocks": [], "diffsForCompressingFiles": [], "relevantFiles": [], "toolResults": [], "notepads": [], "capabilities": [], "multiFileLinterErrors": [], "diffHistories": [], "recentLocationsHistory": [], "recentlyViewedFiles": [], "isAgentic": false, "fileDiffTrajectories": [], "existedSubsequentTerminalCommand": false, "existedPreviousTerminalCommand": false, "docsReferences": [], "webReferences": [], "aiWebSearchResults": [], "requestId": "", "attachedFoldersListDirResults": [], "humanChanges": [], "attachedHumanChanges": false, "summarizedComposers": [], "cursorRules": [], "cursorCommands": [], "cursorCommandsExplicitlySet": false, "pastChats": [], "pastChatsExplicitlySet": false, "contextPieces": [], "editTrailContexts": [], "allThinkingBlocks": [], "diffsSinceLastApply": [], "deletedFiles": [], "supportedTools": [], "tokenCount": {"inputTokens": 0, "outputTokens": 0}, "attachedFileCodeChunksMetadataOnly": [], "consoleLogs": [], "uiElementPicked": [], "isRefunded": false, "knowledgeItems": [], "documentationSelections": [], "externalLinks": [], "projectLayouts": [], "unifiedMode": 2, "capabilityContexts": [], "todos": [], "createdAt": "2026-08-06T15:28:20.580Z", "mcpDescriptors": [], "workspaceUris": [], "conversationState": "~", "text": "", "capabilityType": 30, "thinkingStyle": 1, "thinking": {"text": "The planning artifacts contain no mention of mixins.", "signature": ""}, "thinkingDurationMs": 1}, {"_v": 3, "type": 2, "approximateLintErrors": [], "lints": [], "codebaseContextChunks": [], "commits": [], "pullRequests": [], "attachedCodeChunks": [], "assistantSuggestedDiffs": [], "gitDiffs": [], "interpreterResults": [], "images": [], "attachedFolders": [], "attachedFoldersNew": [], "bubbleId": "4ac04747-21af-4243-bf57-b70e330cef21", "userResponsesToSuggestedCodeBlocks": [], "suggestedCodeBlocks": [], "diffsForCompressingFiles": [], "relevantFiles": [], "toolResults": [], "notepads": [], "capabilities": [], "multiFileLinterErrors": [], "diffHistories": [], "recentLocationsHistory": [], "recentlyViewedFiles": [], "isAgentic": false, "fileDiffTrajectories": [], "existedSubsequentTerminalCommand": false, "existedPreviousTerminalCommand": false, "docsReferences": [], "webReferences": [], "aiWebSearchResults": [], "requestId": "", "attachedFoldersListDirResults": [], "humanChanges": [], "attachedHumanChanges": false, "summarizedComposers": [], "cursorRules": [], "cursorCommands": [], "cursorCommandsExplicitlySet": false, "pastChats": [], "pastChatsExplicitlySet": false, "contextPieces": [], "editTrailContexts": [], "allThinkingBlocks": [], "diffsSinceLastApply": [], "deletedFiles": [], "supportedTools": [], "tokenCount": {"inputTokens": 0, "outputTokens": 0}, "attachedFileCodeChunksMetadataOnly": [], "consoleLogs": [], "uiElementPicked": [], "isRefunded": false, "knowledgeItems": [], "documentationSelections": [], "externalLinks": [], "projectLayouts": [], "unifiedMode": 2, "capabilityContexts": [], "todos": [], "createdAt": "2026-08-06T15:28:20.583Z", "mcpDescriptors": [], "workspaceUris": [], "conversationState": "~", "codeBlocks": [], "text": "# Digest de señal — research JSON→CSS (2026-07-26)\n\n*Solo lo que el research afirma. **Mixins:** no aparecen en este doc ni en planning artifacts.*\n\n### 1. Formatos / ecosistemas\n- **DTCG Format 2025.10** — JSON estable: `$value` (req.), `$type`/`$description`/`$extensions`/`$deprecated`; aliases `{path.to.token}`; herencia `$type` en grupos.\n- **DTCG Resolver 2025.10** — theming multi-file: `sets`, `modifiers`, `resolutionOrder`, `$ref`.\n- **Legacy SD v3** — `value`/`type` sin `$`.\n- **Theo** — YAML/JSON; aliases `{!name}` (legacy).\n- **Tokens Studio** — exports con wrappers a preprocessar; bridge vía `@tokens-studio/sd-transforms`.\n- Taxonomías de naming (no formatos JSON): **3-tier**, **CTI**, **EightShapes**.\n\n### 2. Qué significa “convert to CSS”\nEmisión de **CSS custom properties** en `:root`, selectores de tema (`.dark`, `[data-theme]`), scopes de componente; archivos layered; opcional **Tailwind `@theme` / `@theme inline`**. Preferencia: preservar refs como `var(--…)` (`outputReferences`). **SCSS variables: fuera de MVP.** No implica multi-platform ni clases de utilidad genéricas.\n\n### 3. Capacidades recomendadas (MVP→fases)\nPipeline **ANRE**: Analyze → Normalize → Resolve → EmitCss. API: `analyze` / `resolve` / `emitCss` + CLI `cssgen analyze|build`. DTCG-first + shim legacy; grafo Map + ciclos/dangling; taxonomy report (3-tier/CTI/EightShapes) con confidence + override; kebab naming; prefix/collisions. Fase 1: multi-file, theme selectors, split por tier, `@theme` opcional. Fase 2: Resolver, composites, Color Module 4. TS ESM; **sin dependencia dura de SD/Terrazzo**.\n\n### 4. Non-goals / diferidos\nNo reemplazar SD; coexistir vía DTCG. Evitar Theo en greenfield; parser Theo = baja prioridad. No Figma plugin / iOS-Android. Resolver, composites, gamut = post-MVP. Math: no `eval` inseguro. A11y contrast = hooks opcionales. `$ref`/JSON Pointer: monitorear; MVP = curly aliases. **Mixins: no mencionados.**\n\n### 5. Competencia / peers\nStyle Dictionary, Terrazzo (ex-Cobalt), Tokens Studio + sd-transforms, Theo (legacy). También: Dispersa, SD Configurator, zeroheight, Specify, Supernova; adopters DTCG (Penpot, Figma, Sketch, Framer).\n\n### 6. Riesgos / edge cases / estándares\nDTCG = Community Final ≠ W3C Rec; SD 2025.10 incompleto. Taxonomy ambigua → confidence + `--model`. Collisions CSS; perf en sets grandes (Map); pitfalls `@theme inline` dark. Seguridad: confinar `$ref`, sanitizar identifiers. CTI = heurística; clasificar por `$type`.\n\n### 7. Arquitectura addendum vs PRD producto\n**Arquitectura:** ANRE, Map graph, packaging ESM/CLI, filtros, merge, naming transforms, perf, seguridad de parse, fixture/TDD, ADR DTCG-first.  \n**PRD:** value prop “analyze-then-generate”, complement vs replace SD, personas, outcomes CSS, taxonomías como feature, fases MVP, coexistencia SD/Terrazzo, KPI (p.ej. time-to-first-CSS).\n\n### 8. Decisiones abiertas para el PM\nUmbral de precisión taxonomy; budget perf 10k tokens; alcance `@theme` en MVP vs Fase 1; profundidad legacy (SD v3 / Theo / Tokens Studio); feature-flag Resolver; semver de naming defaults; packaging scope/nombre; si “complement lane” es positioning canónico; convertidores `value`→`$value` in-scope MVP.", "turnDurationMs": 35567}]}